# Applies to every Docker build whose context is the repo root (api, web,
# discovery, etl; deploy/build01-staging.compose.yml, infrastructure/docker/
# docker-compose.yml, tests/e2e/docker-compose.e2e.yml). Works on the legacy
# builder too, unlike a per-Dockerfile <name>.dockerignore (BuildKit only).
#
# Keep out untracked host files that must never reach an image. Do NOT ignore
# dist: Dockerfile.discovery and Dockerfile.etl COPY packages/*/dist from the host.
# Dockerfile.api, which builds from source, deletes the host dist itself right
# after its source COPYs.
.git
**/node_modules
**/.env*
**/*.log
**/logs
# composite TS projects: a stale host tsbuildinfo without dist makes tsc skip emit
**/*.tsbuildinfo
